:''For the other Asuka from the same Gacha, see [[Asuka Langley (Super Rare Cat)]].''
'''Asuka Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was unlocked in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event|Evangelion Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 407
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Asuka Cat
|name2 = Apron Asuka
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Apron Asuka''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Asuka Cat is meant to be a tank against Red enemies, but lacks the health or DPS to be comparable to the likes of [[Viking Cat (Rare Cat)|Maximum the Fighter]] or [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Elemental Duelist Cat]]. Her only real use is on 4-crown stages dominated by Red enemies, as support for anti-Red damage dealers like Elemental Duelist Cat.

{{Job|Classification = Melee & User Rank Dump}}

